---
// PromoHighlights.astro
---

<section class="py-10 bg-white border-b border-stone-200">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base">Gula Aren Murni Nusantara</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Menggunakan 100% nira aren alami tanpa pemanis buatan untuk kenikmatan manis legit yang otentik.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base">Freshly Baked Cerita Roti</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Roti bantal selembut awan berteknologi Jepang, dipanggang fresh setiap pagi tanpa bahan pengawet.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base">Segel Rapat Anti Tumpah</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Kemasan cup dengan mesin seal higienis untuk menjamin suhu dingin & panas tetap terjaga sempurna.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
